# Cloudflare Pages redirects — first match wins.
# Format: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# ----- Permanent redirects (legacy paths) -----
/home              /                  301
/sign-up           /onboarding        301
/signup            /onboarding        301
/get-started       /onboarding        301

# ----- Install script (proxy to canonical S3 / R2 URL) -----
# When the brother provisions the install script bucket, replace the
# placeholder with the actual canonical URL and bump from 302 to 301.
/install.sh        /install         302

# ----- Downloads manifest -----
# `/api/product/downloads` and `/api/product/version` are served by
# Pages Functions (`functions/api/product/{downloads,version}.ts`) so
# they live on the same origin as the SPA. Cloudflare Pages does not
# allow `_redirects` rewrites (status 200) to external origins, which
# is why the external proxy lives in code rather than here.

# ----- SPA fallback — must be last -----
# All other paths render index.html so client router takes over.
/*                 /index.html        200
